Package: RobustMR
Title: Summary-Data Mendelian Randomization with Heterogeneous Samples
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dingke", "Tang", email = "dtang@uottawa.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides summary-data Mendelian randomization estimators using
    external exposure associations and target exposure and outcome associations.
    Includes a Wald-type estimator, SNP-pairs bootstrap inference, a median-score
    estimator, and simulation utilities for heterogeneous first-stage effects.
    Optional comparison utilities interface with other Mendelian randomization
    packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
